2026-10-18T07:19:03.5089232Z   ok   before any solve the plan has no age and is not stale
2026-10-18T07:19:03.5089350Z   ok   three consecutive failed solves raise exactly one repair issue
2026-10-18T07:19:03.5089457Z   ok   the issue carries its translation key and placeholders
2026-10-18T07:19:03.5089556Z   ok   an hour-old plan is not yet stale (90-minute floor)
2026-10-18T07:19:03.5089640Z   ok   past three missed cycles the plan is stale
2026-10-18T07:19:03.5089750Z   ok   the threshold scales with the configured update interval
2026-10-18T07:19:03.5089837Z   ok   a stale plan's schedule step is not applied
2026-10-18T07:19:03.5089917Z   ok   a fresh plan actuates exactly as before
2026-10-18T07:19:03.5090022Z   ok   fixed-rule modes carry no horizon and ignore staleness
2026-10-18T07:19:03.5090127Z   ok   new snapshots no longer carry the peak tracker at all
2026-10-18T07:19:03.5090239Z   ok   a learner rollback leaves the month's realised peaks alone
2026-10-18T07:19:03.5090405Z   ok   an old snapshot still carrying the key is simply ignored
2026-10-18T07:19:03.5090532Z   ok   from_config clamps zero and negative masses to the physical floor
2026-10-18T07:19:03.5090625Z   ok   direct construction runs through the same clamp
2026-10-18T07:19:03.5090752Z   ok   the service-write chokepoint re-clamps after attribute assignment
2026-10-18T07:19:03.5090841Z   ok   no sane configuration ever subdivides a step
